{% comment %}
  Static tab groups for a top-level mega menu item: the left-hand column of the desktop panel.

  Only for menus whose column should not mirror Online Store > Navigation. A top-level item
  that isn't listed here keeps using its own sub-links.

  Accepts:
  - parent: {String} the top-level item's title, e.g. "Jewellery"

  Outputs "Tab|collection-handle|source|Heading" entries separated by commas:
  - Tab is the label in the left-hand column
  - collection-handle is where the heading links; "-" leaves the heading as plain text
  - source is "items" (tiles come from 'menu-static-items' for a group of this tab's name),
    "products" (tiles are that collection's products), or "featured" (the four large cards
    from 'menu-featured-cards' instead of tiles)
  - Heading is the title above the tiles
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign parent_key = parent | handle

  case parent_key
    when 'engagement'
      echo 'By Style|-|items|Shop All'
      echo ',By Shape|-|items|Shop All'
      echo ',By Metal|-|items|Shop All'
      echo ',Featured|-|featured|Featured'
    when 'wedding'
      echo 'By Style|-|items|Shop All'
      echo ',Featured|-|featured|Featured'
    when 'diamonds'
      echo 'Lab-Grown Diamonds|lab-grown-diamonds|items|Shop All'
      comment
        Learn links at pages and guides, not collections, so it has no product photography to
        tile - it was drawing four initials. The big editorial cards carry their own artwork
        and take video, which is what a guide is better sold with. Cards: 'menu-featured-cards'.
      endcomment
      echo ',Learn|-|featured|Learn'
    when 'jewellery' or 'jewelry'
      echo 'Earrings|earrings|items|Shop All Earrings'
      echo ',Necklaces|necklaces|items|Shop All Necklaces'
      comment
        Bracelets and Rings have no sub-categories to tile - the shop sells bracelets, not tennis
        bracelets and bangles - so these tabs show the pieces themselves instead of category tiles.
      endcomment
      echo ',Bracelets|bracelets|products|Shop All Bracelets'
      echo ',Rings|rings|products|Shop All Rings'
      comment
        Shape and Stone browse the whole catalogue rather than one category: a shopper after a
        round stone wants it in a stud as much as in a ring. They read the same `shape:` tags the
        Shape group in the collection filter drawer filters on ('static-filters'), so the menu and
        the drawer cannot drift apart. Tiles and collections: 'menu-static-items', store-config.mjs.
      endcomment
      echo ',Shop by Shape|-|items|Shop by Shape'
      echo ',Shop by Stone|-|items|Shop by Stone'
      echo ',Shop by Metal|-|items|Shop by Metal'
      echo ',Featured|-|featured|Featured'
  endcase
-%}
